# WorldSystem + MapConfig

## Contents
- MapConfig ScriptableObject
- EntryPoint struct
- WorldSystem class
- Đăng ký với VContainer

---

## MapConfig (ScriptableObject)

Mỗi map = 1 asset. Thêm map mới không cần code.

```csharp
[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = "NeverGiveUp/MapConfig")]
public class MapConfig : ScriptableObject
{
    public string mapId;          // "farm", "town", "forest"
    public string sceneName;      // tên scene Unity (phải khớp Build Settings)
    public EntryPoint[] entryPoints;
}

[Serializable]
public struct EntryPoint
{
    public string entryId;        // "from_town", "from_farm", "from_forest"
    public Vector3 position;
    public float rotationY;
}
```

Tìm EntryPoint:
```csharp
bool TryGetEntry(MapConfig map, string entryId, out EntryPoint result)
{
    foreach (var e in map.entryPoints)
    {
        if (e.entryId == entryId) { result = e; return true; }
    }
    result = default;
    return false;
}
```

---

## WorldSystem

Đăng ký ở **GameCtrl**, sống suốt game.

```csharp
public class WorldSystem
{
    readonly MapConfig[] _allMaps;     // inject qua DI — tất cả MapConfig assets
    readonly SaveSystem _saveSystem;
    readonly SceneLoader _sceneLoader; // wrapper UniTask cho LoadScene

    MapConfig _currentMap;
    bool _isTransitioning;

    public string CurrentMapId => _currentMap.mapId;

    // Gọi khi mở game: load map từ save data
    public async UniTask LoadSavedMap(WorldSaveData data)
    {
        _currentMap = FindMap(data.currentMapId);
        await _sceneLoader.LoadAdditive(_currentMap.sceneName);
        // đặt player tại vị trí đã lưu — SceneCtrl lắng nghe event
        GameBus.Send(new OnMapLoaded
        {
            useEntryPoint = false,
            savedPosition  = data.playerPosition,
            savedRotationY = data.playerRotationY
        });
    }

    // Gọi từ MapTransitionTrigger
    public async UniTask TransitionTo(string mapId, string entryId)
    {
        if (_isTransitioning) return;
        _isTransitioning = true;

        GameBus.Send(new OnMapTransitionStarted());   // → FadeSystem fade out

        var nextMap = FindMap(mapId);
        await _sceneLoader.UnloadScene(_currentMap.sceneName);
        await _sceneLoader.LoadAdditive(nextMap.sceneName);

        _currentMap = nextMap;
        _saveSystem.SaveWorldState(CurrentMapId, GetPlayerPosition());

        GameBus.Send(new OnMapLoaded
        {
            useEntryPoint = true,
            entryId       = entryId
        });

        _isTransitioning = false;
    }

    MapConfig FindMap(string id) =>
        System.Array.Find(_allMaps, m => m.mapId == id);
}
```

---

## Messages

```csharp
public struct OnMapTransitionStarted { }

public struct OnMapLoaded
{
    public bool useEntryPoint;
    // useEntryPoint = true  → SceneCtrl dùng entryId để đặt player
    // useEntryPoint = false → SceneCtrl dùng savedPosition
    public string entryId;
    public Vector3 savedPosition;
    public float savedRotationY;
}
```

---

## Đăng ký VContainer (GameCtrl)

```csharp
// trong GameCtrl.ConfigureDependencies()
builder.Register<WorldSystem>(Lifetime.Singleton);
builder.RegisterInstance(allMapConfigs);  // MapConfig[] từ Inspector
```

